							></path></svg
						>
					</Label>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<Section title='About'>
			  <p class='text-muted-foreground'>
			  Hi, I'm <strong><span class="text-red-300">Sooraj</span></strong>, I’m a Product Engineer at <strong><span class="text-red-300">Strollby Inc</span></strong>, and I love solving real-world problems with programming. Most of my work revolves around building backend systems that are practical, reliable, and easy to evolve as products grow.
				I contribute to open-source frameworks like <strong><span class="text-red-300">Agno AGI and Google ADK</span></strong>, and I enjoy sharing what I learn through community talks at events such as <strong><span class="text-red-300">PyData 2025, PyCon Asia 2026, FOSS Asia 2026 and the Trivandrum Python Community </span></strong> around backend engineering, AI systems, and developer productivity.
				I was also a finalist in the <strong><span class="text-red-300">Python Code Jam 2025</span></strong>, where I was recognized for practical, out-of-the-box problem solving.
			  </p>
		</Section>
		<Section title='Skills'>
			{/* <SkillLayout title='Languages' skills={languages} /> */}
			<SkillLayout title='Programming Languages' skills={programming_languages} />
			<SkillLayout title='Frameworks and Tools' skills={frameworks_tools} />
			<SkillLayout title='Backend Development' skills={backend_development} />
			<SkillLayout title='Databases' skills={databases} />
			<SkillLayout title='Cloud Infrastructure' skills={cloud_infrastructure} />
			<SkillLayout title='Observability' skills={monitoring_observability} />
			<SkillLayout title='Agentic Development' skills={agentic_frameworks} />
		</Section>
		<!-- {
			allPostsByDate.length > 0 && (
				<Section title='Posts'>
					<ul class='flex flex-col gap-y-2'>
						{allPostsByDate.map((p) => (
							<li class='flex flex-col gap-x-2 sm:flex-row'>
								<PostPreview post={p} />
							</li>
						))}
					</ul>
				</Section>
			)
		} -->

		<Section title='Experience'>
			<Card
				heading='Product Engineering'
