				date='July 2023 - Present'
				imagePath='/src/assets/strollby_logo.svg'
				altText='Strollby'
				imageClass='h-12 w-auto md:-left-16'
			>
				<ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-muted-foreground space-y-2">
  <li>
    Built ETL pipelines for over
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">4 million+</span></strong>
    hotel listings from providers like
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Amadeus</span></strong>,
    ingesting data into
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">MongoDB</span></strong>
    and powering search & recommendations using
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Elasticsearch</span></strong>.
  </li>

  <li>
    Designed and optimized
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">CI/CD pipelines</span></strong>
    using Bitbucket, reducing deployment time by
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">40%</span></strong>
    and minimizing human errors.
  </li>

  <li>
    Established scalable
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Kubernetes</span></strong>
    deployment workflows on
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">GCP</span></strong>,
    reducing system downtime by
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">60%</span></strong>
    and improving application availability by
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">35%</span></strong>
    under high traffic.
  </li>

  <li>
    Engineered a low-latency
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">GeoLocations Microservice</span></strong>
    delivering
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">sub-80ms (P95)</span></strong>
    responses at
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">500K+ requests/day</span></strong>,
    backed by PostgreSQL, containerized with Docker, and autoscaled on Google Cloud.
  </li>

  <li>
    Hands-on experience with
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Linux systems</span></strong>,
    performance tuning, debugging, and automation pipelines, reducing infrastructure
    bootstrap time.
  </li>

  <li>
    Provisioned and managed infrastructure using
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Terraform</span></strong>,
    improving maintainability, resilience, and secrets management abstraction.
  </li>

  <li>
    Contributed to system reliability by building comprehensive
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Pytest</span></strong>
    test suites and  observability via
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Datadog</span></strong>
    dashboards.
  </li>

  <li>
    Led a team to build an
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Agentic AI Travel Planner & Booking Platform</span></strong>
    with context-aware intelligent agents using
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">LangGraph</span></strong>,
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Google ADK</span></strong>,
    and vector databases.
  </li>
</ul>

			</Card>
			<Card
				heading='Internship'
				subheading='Backend Developer @ Simmi Foundation'
				date='Feb 2023 - Jul 2023'
				imagePath='/src/assets/simmi-foundation.png'
				altText='E4K'
				imageClass='h-12 w-auto md:-left-16'
			>
			<ul class='ml-4 list-disc text-muted-foreground'>
				<li>Deployed a web application on a virtual machine (VM) and optimized server configurations for performance and security</li>
				<li><strong><span class="text-red-300">Optimized database queries</span></strong>, reducing execution time and improving overall efficiency</li>
				<li>Debugged and <strong><span class="text-red-300">resolved critical issues in both backend APIs and frontend integrations</span></strong>, enhancing system stability</li>
			</ul>
			</Card>

		</Section>

		<Section title='Education'>
			<Card
				heading='Bachelor of Technology - Electrical and Electronics Engineering'
				subheading='TKM College Of Engineering, Kerala'
				date='Aug 2019 - Jul 2023'
				imagePath='/src/assets/tkmce.png'
				altText='SJSU'
				imageClass='h-12 w-auto md:-left-16'
