					<li><b>CGPA: 9.1/10</b> </li>
					<li><strong><span class="text-red-300">Minor Degree in Machine Learning</span></strong></b></li>
					<ul>
						<li>- Pothole Detection & Mapping using Deep Learning and Computer Vision</li>
						<li>- Engineered a lightweight real-time indoor navigation system using Computer Vision, featuring a user-friendly web interface.</li>
						<li>- Developed an Automated Page Scroller using OpenCV that detects hand gestures to enable hands-free scrolling for an enhanced reading experience.</li>
					</ul>
				</ul>
			</Card>

		</Section>
		<Section title='Awards and Honours'>
			<Card>
				<ul class="ml-4 list-disc text-muted-foreground space-y-2">
  <li>
    Speaker at
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">PyData Global 2025</span></strong>,
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">PyCon Asia 2026</span></strong>,
    and
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">FOSS Asia 2026</span></strong>.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Python Code Jam Finalist 2025</span></strong>,
    ranked among top international competitors.
  </li>

  <li>
    Open-source contributor to agentic frameworks including
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Google ADK (13K+ stars)</span></strong>
    and
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">Agno (30K+ stars)</span></strong>.
  </li>

  <li>
    Two-time
    <strong><span class="text-red-300">UST “Super Star” Award</span></strong>
    recipient for engineering excellence and delivery impact.
  </li>

  <li>
  <strong>
    <span class="text-red-300">Oracle Certified Foundation Associate</span>
  </strong>
  (ID: 324120383OCI25FNDCFA) —
  <a
    href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1w_PWhFC30aqd_K8UxqhU1XySm0MvBgyC/view?usp=sharing"
    class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-red-300"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    view certificate
  </a>
</li>

</ul>

			</Card>

		</Section>

		<Section title="Projects">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-5 sm:flex-row sm:gap-x-5 sm:gap-y-5">
    <ProjectCard
      href="http://uplog.live/"
      heading="Uplog"
      subheading={`Uplog is a CLI-first logging tool that streams local application logs to the cloud in real time.
It gives you instant, shareable log links with zero setup, built for debugging, collaboration, and production-grade observability.`}
      imagePath="/src/assets/uplog_icon.png"
      altText="Uplog Icon"
      className="w-full sm:w-1/2"
    />
	<ProjectCard
      href="https://github.com/SOORAJTS2001/gazetteer"
      heading="Gazetteer"
      subheading="A fast offline, boundary aware reverse geocoding library in pure python"
      imagePath="/src/assets/Retro-Geo.png"
      altText="Gazetteer"
      className="w-full sm:w-1/2"
    />

    
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-5 sm:flex-row sm:gap-x-5 sm:gap-y-5">
    <ProjectCard
      href="https://jugaad-frontend.vercel.app/"
      heading="Jugaad"
      subheading="JioMart price tracker with ML-based price prediction, async scraping, and alerts for drops. Scalable, efficient, and easily extendable."
      imagePath="/src/assets/jugaad.jpeg"
      altText="Jugaad"
      className="w-full sm:w-1/2"
    />

    <ProjectCard
      href="https://github.com/SOORAJTS2001/igloo"
      heading="Igloo"
      subheading="A modern, responsive web application for managing and searching through various document formats with real-time search using RAG"
      imagePath="/src/assets/igloo.png"
      altText="Igloo"
      className="w-full sm:w-1/2"
    />
  </div>
</Section>
	</div>
</PageLayout>